    "id": "p53-q55-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "55",
    "prompt": "For each of the following, determine if the sets are disjoint or not disjoint.\n$$\\begin{aligned}A&=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}\\\\B&=\\{x\\in\\mathbb Z\\text{ where }x^2>25\\}\\end{aligned}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Disjoint.",
      "worked": "For every $x\\in A$, $x^2\\leq25$. No member satisfies the strict condition $x^2>25$, so $A\\cap B=\\varnothing$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
